{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.BindingGenfunQdifference","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.BindingGenfunQdifference","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Ring.Finset","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fintype.Card","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.binding_qdifference_recurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.binding_qdifference_recurrence","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L64-L89","doc":"**L3.** The body terms obey the depth-`d` linear recurrence read off from\nthe q-difference kernel:\n\n  `B_{n+d} = ∑_{j<d} (-c_{n,j} / c_{n,d}) · B_{n+j}`.\n\n**Derived**, not projected: peel the top (`j = d`) term of the\nannihilation identity `∑_{j≤d} c_j B_{n+j} = 0` and solve for `B_{n+d}`\n(`c_{n,d} ≠ 0`). The coefficients `a_{n,j} = -c_{n,j} / c_{n,d}` are an\noutput of `R` and depend on `n` — the q-holonomic ⟹ q-recursive passage. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:binding-genfun-qdifference","label":"prop:binding-genfun-qdifference","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.leading_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.leading_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L62-L62","doc":"The operator has order exactly `d` at every position: its leading\ncoefficient is nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.annihilates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.annihilates","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The fibre q-difference equation in coefficient form:\n`∑_{j≤d} c_{n,j} B_{n+j} = 0` for all `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.opCoeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.opCoeff","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Coefficients `c_{n,j}(q₀)` of the depth-`d` q-difference annihilating\noperator at position `n`, obtained from `R` by clearing denominators.\nThey depend on `n` through `q^n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.term","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The body-order binding terms `B_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.depth","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Recurrence depth `d` (the window width of the kernel `R`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence.mk","kind":"ctor","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L47-L47","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.BindingQDifferenceRecurrence","kind":"structure","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/binding-genfun-qdifference.lean#L37-L62","doc":"**Binding q-difference data**: the depth `d`, the coefficients `c_j(q₀)`\nof the depth-`d` q-difference annihilating operator obtained from the\nkernel `R` (the coefficient form of `G(qx) = R(q,x) G(x)` after clearing\ndenominators), the body terms `B_n`, the annihilation identity\n`∑_{j≤d} c_j B_{n+j} = 0`, and the order condition `c_d ≠ 0`.\n\nNeither the annihilation identity nor the order condition is the\ndepth-`d` recurrence conclusion: the recurrence is **solved for** from\nthem below, realising the q-holonomic ⟹ P-recursive passage rather\nthan carrying it as a field. ","signatureChunk":0}]}